    "title": "Photo Editor - Face Makeup",
    "description": "<b>Photo Editor - Face Makeup</b> is a professional and photo editor free that provides everything that you want to edit on your photo. In addition to editor <b>face makeup</b>, Photo Editor - Face Makeup application is also a camera selfie, beauty camera and makeup editor free with just simple touches you can create beautiful, high-quality photos with your favorite filters without any professional skills.\r\nWith <b>Photo Editor - Face Makeup</b> you can create masterpiece photos because a photo editor that provides all the photo editing tools and beauty camera you need - beauty cam, sweet selfie, photo effects, face filters, makeup filter, facetune, editor face makeup, theme, stickers, background and much more. Plus you can change lipstick, blush, eyebrow, hair color, etc. with makeup styles from ancient to modern, innocent to cold, etc.\r\nThe video function in <b>Photo Editor - Face Makeup</b>: Experiment with different hair colors while recording your videos, add accessory, adjust foundation, eyeshadow, eyeliner, mascara, lipstick, eye and more to match your desired style. \r\nYou're creating vlogs, beauty tutorials, or simply capturing memorable moments, our video beauty mode empower you do that.\r\n:two_hearts::two_hearts::two_hearts:\r\n:camera_with_flash:<b>Photo Editor & Camera Selfie</b>\r\n\u2606 Shape: Drag to retouch cheeks, chin, eye, forehead, mouth, nose, lip, etc.\r\n\u2606 Remove unwanted acne and blemish with the touch of a finger with the natural beauty effects of the photo editor.\r\n\u2606 \u00a0200+ photo effects, photo filters, text, stickers, photo background for photo editor.\r\n\u2606 Remove unwanted objects in photos instantly!\r\n\u2606 Adjust brightness, contrast, saturation, highlight, blur, etc to get the most vivid colors for the photo.\r\n\u2606 There are many image formats for different social networks so you don\u2019t need to crop your photos when you post them.\r\n\u2606 Use live photo editor effects to take amazing pictures with just one tap.\r\n\u2606 Crop, rotate photos super fast as you want.\r\n:lipstick:Beautiful face makeup for your photo\r\n\u2606 Take beautiful and creative selfies with amazing makeup filter.\r\n\u2606 Adjust your favorite lipstick, blush, eyebrow, mascara, eyeliner with just one simple touch.\r\n\u2606 With the photo editor you can adjust the eyes big - small, makeup for eye, lip, hair color, lens to match your photo.\r\n\u2606 Add accessories like glasses, hats, earrings, necklaces to make the photo look more lively and interesting.\r\n\u2606 Remove skin imperfections in your photo simply & quickly and professional.\r\n\u2606 Retouch face, contour, hairline, whiten teeth, slim & lift nose easily and conveniently for a beautiful photo.\r\n:crown:Highlights of Photo Editor - Face Makeup\r\n\u2606 Selfie camera, beauty cam, face makeup and amazing makeup filter.\r\n\u2606 Collage photos together to create amazing collages with multiple frame or grid layouts to choose from.\r\n\u2606 Remove objects, beautify plus remove skin imperfections naturally.\r\n\u2606 Editor face makeup, face slimming as you like.\r\n\u2606 Add photo effects, face filters, beauty makeup filter, stickers, photo backgrounds and simple text.\r\n\u2606 Share high quality edited images with friends on social networking sites like: Twitter, Facebook, Instagram, etc.\r\nWith all the powerful and special features above, <b>Photo Editor - Face Makeup</b> will help you become a professional photo editor, a makeup artist with artistic and creative photos.\r\nDownload Photo Editor - Face Makeup app now to enjoy perfect selfies with the best beauty camera, <b>face makeup</b>, makeup plus photo editor!",
